{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09394","headline":"晚出府舍与独孤兵曹令狐士曹南寻朱雀街归里第 · 韦应物","name":"晚出府舍与独孤兵曹令狐士曹南寻朱雀街归里第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分曹幸同简，联骑方惬素。\n还从广陌归，不觉青山暮。\n翻翻鸟未没，杳杳钟犹度。\n寻草远无人，望山多枉路。\n聊参世士迹，尝得静者顾。\n出入虽见牵，忘身缘所晤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}